              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.2+NUM.20.3+NUM.20.4+NUM.20.5+NUM.20.6+NUM.20.7+NUM.20.8+NUM.20.9+NUM.20.10+NUM.20.11+NUM.20.12+NUM.20.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isabu 20:2–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli osi auka kula jangbwa ra Sini, achinyendeka kula phatu phamwenga hadi phanjina dza Mwenyezi Mlungu arivyolagiza. Achita kambi Refidimu, ela kala taphana madzi ga kunwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo atu amugombera Musa achimuamba, “Huphe madzi ga kunwa hunafwa na chiru.” Musa achiamba, “Kpwa utu wani munanidemurira mimi? Mbona munamjeza Mwenyezi Mlungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Aiziraeli akala na chiru kuko, na achinungʼunikira Musa. Amuamba, “Kpwadze wahutuluza Misiri phamwenga na ana ehu na mifugo yehu ili wedze huolage na chiru?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Musa achimririra Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Atu hano mino nindaahendadze? Mana phapho achiphofika taakure na kunipiga mawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wamjibu Musa achimuamba, “Tsupa mbere za atu osi, uphiye phamwenga na atumia anjina a Iziraeli chisha tsukula mwako mkpwononi ndatayo uriyoihumira kupigira madzi ga muho wa Naili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindaima mbere zenu kpwenye mbarara hiko mwango wa Horebu. Nawe piga iyo mbarara na madzi gandatuluka ili atu anwe.” Phahi, Musa wahenda hivyo mbere za atumia a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phatu hipho phatungbwa dzina phachiihwa Masa na Meriba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chieburania",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Masa",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kupima",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ", na",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Meriba",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kulumbana.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sababu Aiziraeli anungʼunika na achimjeza Mwenyezi Mlungu ariphouza, “Ela kpweli ye Mwenyezi Mlungu a phamwenga naswi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho, kpwakpwedza atu aihwao Aamaleki achedzapigana na Aiziraeli pho Refidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achimuamba Joshuwa, “Tsambula alume kahi-kahi yehu akapigane viha na Aamaleki. Nami muhondo nindaima dzulu ya chirere cha mwango, kuno nkagbwira hira ndata ya kuhendera vilinje vya Mlungu mwangu mkpwononi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Joshuwa wahenda dza Musa arivyomlagiza na achipigana na Aamaleki. Musa, Aruni na Huri achikpwera dzulu ya hura mwango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichikala wakati wosi Musa ariphounula mkpwonowe dzulu, Aiziraeli kala anaturya na ariphoutsereza Aamaleki kala anaturya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mikono ya Musa yaremwa. Hipho Aruni na Huri amsengezera dziwe naye achirisagarira. Nao achiima hiku na hiku achimgbwira mikonoye na achiyiunula hadi dzuwa richitswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa njira iyo Joshuwa waashinda Aamaleki osi tsetsetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.17+DEU.25.18+DEU.25.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 25:17–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.2+1SA.15.3+1SA.15.4+1SA.15.5+1SA.15.6+1SA.15.7+1SA.15.8+1SA.15.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 15:2–9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuamba Musa, “Dzambo hiri chirohendeka rero riandike chitabuni, ili rikale kumbukumbu kpwa atu. Tsona hakikisha Joshuwa akasikira kukala nindaangamiza Aamaleki duniani hata ayalwe tsetsetse.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa wadzenga phatu pha kulavira sadaka achiphaiha, “Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiye bendera yangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bendera yangu",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "manage kpwa Chieburania ni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kunipha ushindi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achiamba, “Iunuleni dzulu yo bendera ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Mwenyezi Mlungu andaenderera kupigana na Aamaleki chivyazi hadi chivyazi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
